# Ported from boltkit test/scripts/v4.0/return_1.bolt
# (neo4j-drivers/boltkit, branch 4.3 at 687a479).
# Adapted to Bolt 4.4: the version is 4.4, `!: AUTO RESET` is dropped (it
# tells boltkit's stub server to answer RESET; this harness is the client),
# and the RUN SUCCESS asserts only `fields` (boltkit's `"qid": 789` was the
# stub's invented value).
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: RUN "RETURN 1" {} {}
   PULL {"n": -1}
S: SUCCESS {"fields": ["1"]}
   RECORD [1]
   SUCCESS {}
